	key[]: "registration_not_possible_steamid_mismatch"
	val[]: "无法连接内容，因为当前 Steam 账号已经和另一个卡车世界账号关联。" #+ The message displayed when the current Steam account is connected to any world of trucks account that is not a currently used World of Trucks account.

