	key[]: "inventory_loading_failed_content"
	val[]: "加载 Steam 库存内容时出现错误。<br><br>$ERROR$<br><br>选择“继续”以保持内容启用。游戏会定期地搜索它。<br><br>你可以暂时禁用库存内容，以防止像这样的错误消息重复出现。游戏将在下次运行时自动重新启用库存内容。" #+ The error message showed in truck configurator screen when Steam inventory content is not present due to loading error. The $ERROR$ must be keeped untranslated.

	key[]: "inventory_loading_request_failed_content"
	val[]: "无法下载 Steam 库存物品。" #+ The error message showed in truck configurator screen when game fails to send Steam inventory request.

	key[]: "inventory_wait_t"
